claim.claim-text:
a radar system (104) configured to detect radar-based gestures on behalf of application subscribers, the application subscribers being applications, services, or components that receive an output from a gesture-recognition model (621), wherein the gesture-recognition model (621) is a part of the user equipment (102);
an inertial measurement unit that receives inertial sensor data;
a processor (608); and
a state machine (2000) configured to transition between multiple states for controlling the radar system (104) based on the inertial sensor data and context-sensitive transition functions (2008), the state machine (2000) is performed on the processor (608) and including:
